  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO extrabudgetary cooperation in 2012/2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO, the UN&#xbf;s specialized agency for education, research, culture and communication, is mandated to promoted international cooperation through education, culture and science. UNESCO works to promote education at all levels, scientific research and communication with the aim to support efforts in development and environmental protection, protection of cultural heritage, cultural exchange, free media and exchange of information and the promotion of respect for human rights and democracy. The voluntary contribution from Denmark has exclusively focused on UNESCOs development activities.</narrative>
  </description>
